{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"smoked_fish","model_identifier":"smoked_fish","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## smoked_fish\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.6..0.6, y -10.5..0.5, z -4.0..4.0 (size 1.2 x 11.0 x 8.0 u = 3 x 31 x 22 cm).\nSmoked fish: two golden-brown smoked fish hung head-up by a cord through the gills; the middle of the cord is the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.5.\n"},"description":"## smoked_fish\n\nFood prop.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.6..0.6, y -10.5..0.5, z -4.0..4.0 (size 1.2 x 11.0 x 8.0 u = 3 x 31 x 22 cm).\nSmoked fish: two golden-brown smoked fish hung head-up by a cord through the gills; the middle of the cord is the grip. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 10.5.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"cord","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.25,-0.5,-4.0],"to":[0.25,0.5,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,11,18.5,12.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2,11,10.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[19,11,19.5,12.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[10,11,18.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[20,0,20.5,8.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[21,0,21.5,8.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a70f9f70-7ba7-5bd1-b58c-f2fa8e0114d6"},{"name":"fish_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-9.0,-4.0],"to":[0.6,-1.5,-1.0],"autouv":0,"color":